	"children": [{
			"objName": "Pallet",
			"scriptComments": [[5, 5, 163, 213, true, -1, "ONLY USE THESE COLORS!!!\rAlso, parts are in the backdrop's Sounds."],
				[5, 262, 475, 749, true, -1, "I know it's like \"Alone-- SHIPPING MAP???\" but I take the song a different way. The song doesn't really have a certian meaning, and I like it as a love song.\rThe song is called \"Alone\" and it is made by \"Marshmello.\"\rAll the lyrics in this song say, \"I'm so alone, nothing feels like home, I'm so alone, trying to find my way back home to you,\" just so you know :)\rI used most of the rules from @starri so thanks :D I also copied the background's design soooo thanks again @starri ♥\r\rRules:\r\r- Only lineart animations allowed.\r\r- Only experienced animators unless I say, thanks! :D\r\r- Get your part done on time! The deadline is August 20th, but it may be extended.\r\r- If I don't respond in a very long time, you don't get the part.\r\r- If it is not about a shipping\/couple, you will not have the part. This is a SHIPPING MAP.\r\r- Please only use one sprite.\r\r- I mostly want you to draw cats, dogs, or any animal but if you REALLY want to draw humans you can.\r\r- You can have some PMV-ish parts in your part, but there HAS to be some animation.\r\r- You can only use the colors on the pallet. (Found inside the project) The colors are not found on the scratch default colors.\r\r- Say your favorite animal as the code!\r\r- Tell me the shipping you will use. Example: BobXJudy... Your ship can be cannon, OCs, whatever.\r\r- If you want to get in, send an animation! It helps me to choose.\r\r- Remix this project for your parts.\r\r- Make the background black and do not animate it.\r\r- If you have the outro, add in \"thanks for watching\" please\r\r- If you do not read the rules, you don't get a part. Simple as that."]],
